cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HybriDock-Pep, please cite it using these metadata, and name the release or commit you ran."
title: "HybriDock-Pep"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Protein-peptide docking and scoring. A diffusion model (RAPiDock) samples peptide poses against a
  receptor structure; a physics-informed rescoring stage ranks them and reports a calibrated binding
  free energy in kcal/mol, with an optional selectivity score (the difference in binding between two
  receptors). It is designed to run on consumer hardware. Developed for iGEM 2026.
authors:
  - name: "HybriDock-Pep contributors"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-08-02"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Tasty-Ramen2010/hybridock-pep"
